[en.FOCUS_C12_STANDARDIZE_MILITARY_PROFESSIONALISM]
Standardize Military Professionalism

[en.FOCUS_C12_STANDARDIZE_MILITARY_PROFESSIONALISM_desc]
Now, I possess a vast army; however, neither this army nor its commanders have ever been tested in actual combat. Fortunately, the world is growing increasingly turbulent. If we can learn from the conflicts occurring in various regions, we can make up for this shortcoming. At the same time, further improvements to our military system should be put on the agenda as soon as possible.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_STANDARDIZE_MILITARY_PROFESSIONALISM]
规范化军队素养

[zh.FOCUS_C12_STANDARDIZE_MILITARY_PROFESSIONALISM_desc]
如今，我已经拥有了一支庞大的军队，然而，这支军队和其将领都从未经历过实战考验。好在，世界正在变得动荡不安，如果能从各个地区中发生的冲突中吸取经验和教训，便可以弥补这一缺点。同时，对军队体系进一步改良也该早日提上议程。

